    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4181" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλι-εύς</span></b> (laterwritten <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλεεύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Is.</u>
					19.8
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				4.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFlor.</u>
				127.15
			</span></i>), ὁ, gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>, lon. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆος</span>, and 
				contr.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλιῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					200
				</span></i>
			: acc. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλιέας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					190.17
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				155.1
			</span></i>; gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλιέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					76.5
				</span></i>
			: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλς, ἅλιος</span>
				A):—<i>one who has to do with the sea</i>, and so,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>fisher</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.251
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				22.384
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				115
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ion</u>
				539e
			</span></i>, etc.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνὴρ ἁ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					214
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>seaman, sailor</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				24.419
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρέτας ἁλιῆας</span> rowers
				<i>on the sea</i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.349
			</span></i>; as Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλιεὺς
			στρατός</span> Opp.H.<i><span class="en">
				5.121
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> a fish, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάτραχος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				620b12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.978d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				3.21.5
			</span></i>.</div>
